# 08: CATCH (a tap of Y on a kit lane) and the slice view, cut at the hits.
title CATCH AND SLICES
about Y on a kit lane catches the last bars the song played and puts them on the lane. L1 opens its slices; hold A and push right on the lane's name and the slices are cut where the drums land.
caption CATCH + SLICES
run --demo --view kit --samples $SAMPLES
from 4.2
length 25.0

4.4 say The kit.
5.6 say Hold Y, left: CATCH one bar.
5.6 hold Y 2.2
6.4 tap LEFT
8.6 say Tap Y: the last bar, on the lane.
9.0 tap Y
11.4 say L1: its slices.
11.6 tap L1
13.4 say On the name, hold A, right: cut at the hits.
13.4 tap LEFT 5 0.18
14.4 hold A 2.8
14.8 tap RIGHT 3 0.6
17.6 say Hold R1, drag: in order.
17.6 tap RIGHT
18.0 hold R1 2.4
18.3 press RIGHT 1.8
21.0 say Up, down: another slice.
21.0 tap LEFT 5 0.15
22.0 tap UP 3 0.4
23.4 tap DOWN 2 0.4
